 174:./core_cm4.h  ****   \brief   Instruction Synchronization Barrier
 175:./core_cm4.h  ****   \details Instruction Synchronization Barrier flushes the pipeline in the processor,
 176:./core_cm4.h  ****            so that all instructions following the ISB are fetched from cache or memory,
 177:./core_cm4.h  ****            after the instruction has been completed.
 178:./core_cm4.h  ****  */
